WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.437 --> 00:00:03.525
Unit five. What is AI!

2
00:00:04.447 --> 00:00:09.455
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.505 --> 00:00:13.197
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.247 --> 00:00:17.134
Today we learn about What is AI. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.878 --> 00:00:22.778
AI. Say it with me. AI!

6
00:00:26.268 --> 00:00:30.835
Smart helper. Say it with me. Smart helper!

7
00:00:34.364 --> 00:00:38.464
Robot. Say it with me. Robot!

8
00:00:41.971 --> 00:00:45.837
Learn. Say it with me. Learn!

9
00:00:49.287 --> 00:00:53.385
Answer. Say it with me. Answer!

10
00:00:56.901 --> 00:01:01.858
Voice assistant. Say it with me. Voice assistant!

11
00:01:05.376 --> 00:01:10.310
Computer brain. Say it with me. Computer brain!

12
00:01:13.781 --> 00:01:17.731
Helpful. Say it with me. Helpful!

13
00:01:21.269 --> 00:01:38.521
AI stands for Artificial Intelligence, which means a smart helper built by computers. A voice assistant can listen and answer my question because it can learn. AI is like a helpful computer brain, but it is not the same as a real person.

14
00:01:38.571 --> 00:01:42.486
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:43.488 --> 00:01:48.969
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:49.019 --> 00:01:50.169
Robot!

17
00:01:51.122 --> 00:01:56.637
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:56.687 --> 00:01:58.259
Computer brain!

19
00:01:59.278 --> 00:02:08.694
Did you know? AI helpers learn from millions of examples, kind of like how you learn from practicing something many times!

20
00:02:08.744 --> 00:02:11.327
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:12.167 --> 00:02:23.248
Think and answer. What is one way a smart helper or AI has helped you?

22
00:02:23.298 --> 00:02:24.677
Great answer!

23
00:02:25.413 --> 00:02:31.836
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:31.886 --> 00:02:35.244
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

